3
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:41,710
Krishnamurti in dialogue with Dr. Alan

4
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:45,360
W. Anderson. J. Krishnamurti was born in

5
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:47,939
South India and educated in England. For

6
00:00:47,939 --> 00:00:50,519
the past 40 years he has been speaking

7
00:00:50,519 --> 00:00:53,039
in the United States, Europe, India,

8
00:00:53,039 --> 00:00:55,560
Australia, and other parts of the world.

9
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,920
From the outset of his life's

10
00:00:57,920 --> 00:01:00,280
work he repudiated all connections with

11
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:02,760
organized religions and ideologies and said

12
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:05,239
that his only concern was to set

13
00:01:05,239 --> 00:01:08,360
men absolutely unconditionally free. He is

14
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:11,480
the author of many books, among them

15
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:14,300
The Awakening of Intelligence, The Urgency

16
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:17,120
