19
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:25,800
and Dr. Alan W. Anderson, who

20
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:27,900
is professor of religious studies at San

21
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:30,080
Diego State University where he teaches

22
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:32,260
Indian and Chinese scriptures and the

23
00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:35,280
oracular tradition. Dr. Anderson, a

24
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:38,300
published poet, received his degree from

25
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:40,540
Columbia University and the Union

26
00:01:40,540 --> 00:01:42,780
Theological Seminary. He has been honored

27
00:01:42,780 --> 00:01:45,860
with a Distinguished Teaching Award

28
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:48,940
from the California State Universities.

29
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:52,360
Mr. Krishnamurti, in our last

30
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:55,300
conversation we were beginning to talk

31
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:59,640
about consciousness and its relation to death

32
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:03,980
in the context of living as a

33
00:02:03,980 --> 00:02:07,220
total movement. And we even touched

34
00:02:07,220 --> 00:02:10,460
